Z||000002||rogergarrison||02-06-2001||07:10 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by sqoach:<BR><B>anyone have an idea???</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>a hot, ignition and ground ought to be ez with a test lite. You can take 2 wires at a time for speakers and hold them on a flashlite battery to find out which is which. one will buzz when you have the two for it. I hope it isnt the premium system that has like 10 speakers, that would be a nitemare. May be easier to just run new wire to all the speakers you want to use. I just traded off my 88 town car.<P>||||reg||1
Z||000003||Philphine||02-06-2001||10:52 AM||||if you stil need a wiring diagram, i've gotten them for various cars at my local library. worth a shot if you're near one.||||reg||1
