Z||000005||rogergarrison||02-06-2001||02:14 PM||||some cars only use speakers with only hot wire and ground the other to chassis. If your radio is not set up for that way you can fry your radio.<p>[This message has been edited by rogergarrison (edited 02-06-2001).]||||reg||1
